{"id":"v09-17","volume":9,"volumeTitle":"卷九","volumeSubtitle":"唐宋文","index":17,"title":{"t":"諫院題名記","s":"谏院题名记"},"book":{"t":"司馬光","s":"司马光"},"sourceHead":{"t":"","s":""},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"古时候，进谏并没有专门的官职。","tokens":[{"t":"古","s":"古","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"諫","s":"谏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"無","s":"无","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"官","s":"官","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"从公卿大夫一直到工匠和商人，没有谁不能进谏。","tokens":[{"t":"自","s":"自","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"公","s":"公","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"卿","s":"卿","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"夫","s":"夫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"至","s":"至","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"工","s":"工","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"商","s":"商","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"無","s":"无","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"得","s":"得","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"諫","s":"谏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"汉朝建立以后，才开始设置谏官。","tokens":[{"t":"漢","s":"汉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"興","s":"兴","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"來","s":"来","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"始","s":"始","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"置","s":"置","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"官","s":"官","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"把天下的政事、四海的百姓，连同其中的得失利弊，都汇到一个官职上让他说出来，这个担子也就很重了。","tokens":[{"t":"夫","s":"夫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"以","s":"以","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"天","s":"天","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"下","s":"下","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"政","s":"政","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"四","s":"四","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"海","s":"海","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"衆","s":"众","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"得","s":"得","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"失","s":"失","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"利","s":"利","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"病","s":"病","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"萃","s":"萃","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"一","s":"一","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"官","s":"官","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"使","s":"使","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"言","s":"言","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"爲","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"任","s":"任","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"亦","s":"亦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"重","s":"重","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"矣","s":"矣","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"担任这个官职的人，应当抓住大事，放开细事。","tokens":[{"t":"居","s":"居","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"是","s":"是","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"官","s":"官","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"當","s":"当","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"志","s":"志","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"大","s":"大","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"舍","s":"舍","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"細","s":"细","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"急迫的事放在前头，可以从缓的事放在后头。","tokens":[{"t":"先","s":"先","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"急","s":"急","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"後","s":"后","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"緩","s":"缓","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"只为国家谋利益，不为自己盘算。","tokens":[{"t":"專","s":"专","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"利","s":"利","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"國","s":"国","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"家","s":"家","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"爲","s":"为","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"身","s":"身","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"謀","s":"谋","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"那些急切追求名声的人，就和急切追求私利的人一样。","tokens":[{"t":"彼","s":"彼","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"汲","s":"汲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"汲","s":"汲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"名","s":"名","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"者","s":"者","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"猶","s":"犹","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"汲","s":"汲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"汲","s":"汲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"利","s":"利","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"这两者之间又能隔开多远呢。","tokens":[{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"閒","s":"闲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"相","s":"相","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"去","s":"去","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"何","s":"何","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"遠","s":"远","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"哉","s":"哉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"天禧初年，真宗下诏设置六名谏官，责令他们履行职责。","tokens":[{"t":"天","s":"天","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"禧","s":"禧","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"初","s":"初","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"真","s":"真","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"宗","s":"宗","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"詔","s":"诏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"置","s":"置","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"諫","s":"谏","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"官","s":"官","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"六","s":"六","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"員","s":"员","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"責","s":"责","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"職","s":"职","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"事","s":"事","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"庆历年间，钱君才开始把姓名写在木版上。","tokens":[{"t":"慶","s":"庆","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歷","s":"历","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"中","s":"中","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"錢","s":"钱","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"君","s":"君","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"始","s":"始","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"書","s":"书","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"名","s":"名","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"版","s":"版","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"我司马光担心日子久了字迹磨灭，便在嘉祐八年刻到石头上。","tokens":[{"t":"光","s":"光","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"恐","s":"恐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"久","s":"久","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"漫","s":"漫","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"滅","s":"灭","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"嘉","s":"嘉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"祐","s":"祐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"八","s":"八","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"年","s":"年","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"刻","s":"刻","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"著","s":"著","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"於","s":"于","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"石","s":"石","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"后来的人会逐一指着这些名字议论：这个人忠诚，那个人欺诈，这个人正直，那个人邪僻。","tokens":[{"t":"後","s":"后","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"將","s":"将","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"歷","s":"历","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"指","s":"指","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"名","s":"名","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"而","s":"而","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"議","s":"议","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"曰","s":"曰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"某","s":"某","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"忠","s":"忠","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"某","s":"某","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"詐","s":"诈","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"某","s":"某","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"直","s":"直","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"某","s":"某","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"也","s":"也","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"曲","s":"曲","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]},{"tr":"唉，能够不因此戒惧吗。","tokens":[{"t":"嗚","s":"呜","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"呼","s":"呼","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"可","s":"可","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"愳","s":"愳","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"哉","s":"哉","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"司马光这篇短记，写于嘉祐八年他把谏官姓名由木版改刻上石的时候。宋代谏院专管规谏。真宗天禧初年曾诏令设置谏官六员，并要求他们切实办事；庆历年间，文中称为钱君的人开始把任职者的姓名书写在木版上。司马光担心木版年久字迹磨灭，才换成石刻。记文没有铺陈刻石的工料，而是先说明进谏在古代本无专职，人人都可以说，汉代以后才收拢到谏官一人身上，好让读者明白石上的名字不是荣誉，而是会被后人指点的记录。","theme":"文章要说的是谏官责任重大，不是姓名光彩。天下政事和百姓的利害得失，都集中到这个职位上说出来，说得对不对，影响远超过本人。所以在位者该记住大事、舍开细事，急事在前、缓事在后，只为国家谋利，不为自身打算。司马光还把求名和求利看成同一类心思：谏官未必能直接取财，却最容易拿进谏去博取声名。结尾设想后人挨个指着石上的名字，评论谁忠、谁诈、谁直、谁曲，题名于是变成监督，做这个官的人应当感到害怕。","technique":"全文很短，转折却有好几层。先用古代人人可谏抬高一层，再落到汉朝才设专职，责任便从众人收成一官，显出其重。中间用对句规定做法：抓住大事对舍弃细事，急务在先对缓务在后，最后收到只为国家、不为自身。求名和求利的比较只下一句反问，不再展开。叙事把天禧设官、庆历书版、嘉祐刻石按时间排开，每件一两句。末段连用四个「某也」，像后人当面指点，再用反问收住，石头上的姓名因此有了重量。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"谏","reading":"jiàn","note":"向君主指出过失。古代起初没有专职，后来才设谏官专司此事。"},{"word":"萃","reading":"cuì","note":"聚集。政事、民情和利害都聚到谏官这一个职位上。"},{"word":"汲汲","reading":"jí jí","note":"急切追求的样子。文中用来写追名，并把它和追利看成一类。"},{"word":"漫灭","reading":"màn miè","note":"字迹磨掉、消失。司马光担心木版上的姓名日久看不清，所以改刻在石上。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"夫","reading":"fú","note":"句首发语词，引出后面的议论，没有实在意义。"},{"word":"哉","reading":"zāi","note":"语气词。用在「可不愳哉」末尾，表示反问，意在必须戒惧。"},{"word":"者","reading":"zhě","note":"「古者」的者放在时间词后，表示那个时候；「居是官者」的者则指担任这个官的人。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"专利","note":"这里是专一为国家谋求利益。今天的专利指法律上的独占权利，意思不同。"},{"word":"工商","note":"指工匠和商人两类人，用来代表职位低下的百姓，不是现代工商业的合称。"}],"phoneticLoans":[{"word":"闲","loan":"间","note":"「其闲相去何远哉」的闲通间，指求名和求利两者中间的距离。"},{"word":"愳","loan":"惧","note":"愳是惧的异体，害怕。末句要读者对石上的名字感到戒惧。"}],"flexibleUsage":[{"word":"志","note":"本指心意，这里作动词，把大事记在心里、专注于大事。"},{"word":"先","note":"「先其急」的先作动词，把急迫的事放在前面。后一句的后同样作动词。"},{"word":"利","note":"「专利国家」的利作动词，给国家带来好处。"}],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"反问","note":"「可不愳哉」用否定加疑问，表示不能不怕，比直说更有压力。"},{"name":"判断句","note":"「彼汲汲于名者，犹汲汲于利也」用者字提示主语，也字收束，把求名断成和求利同类。"}]},"classicComment":{"t":"文僅百餘字、而曲折萬狀、包括無遺。尤妙在末後一結。後世以題名爲榮、此獨以題名爲懼。立論不磨、文之有關世道者。","s":"文仅百余字、而曲折万状、包括无遗。尤妙在末后一结。后世以题名为荣、此独以题名为惧。立论不磨、文之有关世道者。"}}
